e released as loved ones  turned to the heavens for relief  the investigation into exactly what  happened here is expected to go on for  months but lawyers tell us that here in  italy if someone is convicted of killing  someone and driving with that level of  blood alcohol in their system they could  face eight to 12 years in prison  for cbs saturday morning seth doan for  chia italy
 

